{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":11,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":1747,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1838477,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":277173,"Name":"JennaMarie901","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277173.jpg?_r=1395012379","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1395015713,"LastPoster":{"Id":270119,"Name":"shugapop1","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270119.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":89,"Preview":{"Id":1882384,"PostDate":1420828578,"PostContent":"I agree with you. I did my wedding at Sandals\u00a0 Whitehouse\u00a0 on June 7,2014. I went with free hot...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shugapop12@aol.com","IpAddress":"66.87.100.226","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1369920425,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270119.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"shugapop1","Id":270119,"Name":"shugapop1","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.115.233.155","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76602,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"730853c37190cb42c760faa8b63608c0","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi All! We are having our DW at Sandals Montego Bay &amp;nbsp;this November &amp;nbsp;1 12014 &amp;nbsp; with &amp;nbsp;approximately 20 of our closest friends and family, A couple of questions I have for anyone who has been married at sandals.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Has anyone ever had a similar situation&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Ceremony 3pm with some picture taking afterwards&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Followed by cocktail hour&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Followed by sit down dinner&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Followed by reception. ( i am hoping to have a lounge\/firepit type area) with tiki torches etc.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Just wondering if the progression of your evening went smoothly and if &amp;nbsp;you were able to change locations for each &amp;nbsp;(cocktail hr\/ dinner\/ reception).&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;i Wanted to do hanging lanterns for the cocktail hour and then the lit up stars for dinner since it will be dark out most definitely by then.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Anyone hire any of the entertainment like the fire dancers? etc?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Has anyone used a DJ through Sandals or hired any of the calypso bands...steel drum players? etc.....&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Your input is greatly appreciated XOX&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1838477,"PostDate":1395015713,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi All! We are having our DW at Sandals Montego Bay \u00a0this November \u00a01 12014 \u00a0 with \u00a0approximately 20 of our closest friends and family, A couple of questions I have for anyone who has been married at sandals.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Has anyone ever had a similar situation<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Ceremony 3pm with some picture taking afterwards<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Followed by cocktail hour<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Followed by sit down dinner\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Followed by reception. ( i am hoping to have a lounge\/firepit type area) with tiki torches etc.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Just wondering if the progression of your evening went smoothly and if \u00a0you were able to change locations for each \u00a0(cocktail hr\/ dinner\/ reception).<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>i Wanted to do hanging lanterns for the cocktail hour and then the lit up stars for dinner since it will be dark out most definitely by then.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Anyone hire any of the entertainment like the fire dancers? etc?<\/p>\n<p>Has anyone used a DJ through Sandals or hired any of the calypso bands...steel drum players? etc.....<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Your input is greatly appreciated XOX<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>One Love\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/><\/p>\n<p>Jenna","Email":"jennamarie901@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"69.115.233.155","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1395014423,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277173.jpg?_r=1395012379","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JennaMarie901","Id":277173,"Name":"JennaMarie901","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"209.6.118.164","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76602,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"39e321726a33fe2f57715494834f2097","RawContent":"[quote name=\"JennaMarie901\" post=\"1838477\" timestamp=\"1395012113\"]\nHi All! We are having our DW at Sandals Montego Bay  this November  1 12014   with  approximately 20 of our closest friends and family, A couple of questions I have for anyone who has been married at sandals. \n\nHas anyone ever had a similar situation\n\nCeremony 3pm with some picture taking afterwards\n\nFollowed by cocktail hour\n\nFollowed by sit down dinner \n\nFollowed by reception. ( i am hoping to have a lounge\/firepit type area) with tiki torches etc.\n\n\nJust wondering if the progression of your evening went smoothly and if  you were able to change locations for each  (cocktail hr\/ dinner\/ reception).\n\ni Wanted to do hanging lanterns for the cocktail hour and then the lit up stars for dinner since it will be dark out most definitely by then.\n\nAnyone hire any of the entertainment like the fire dancers? etc?\nHas anyone used a DJ through Sandals or hired any of the calypso bands...steel drum players? etc.....\n\nYour input is greatly appreciated XOX[\/quote]\nI would also be interested if anyone had any input on this. LOL  \n\nWhich Resort are you getting married at JennaMarie?","Attachments":[],"Id":1848182,"PostDate":1399219811,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>JennaMarie901, on 16 March 2014 - 04:21 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hi All! We are having our DW at Sandals Montego Bay \u00a0this November \u00a01 12014 \u00a0 with \u00a0approximately 20 of our closest friends and family, A couple of questions I have for anyone who has been married at sandals.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Has anyone ever had a similar situation<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Ceremony 3pm with some picture taking afterwards<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Followed by cocktail hour<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Followed by sit down dinner\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Followed by reception. ( i am hoping to have a lounge\/firepit type area) with tiki torches etc.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Just wondering if the progression of your evening went smoothly and if \u00a0you were able to change locations for each \u00a0(cocktail hr\/ dinner\/ reception).<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>i Wanted to do hanging lanterns for the cocktail hour and then the lit up stars for dinner since it will be dark out most definitely by then.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Anyone hire any of the entertainment like the fire dancers? etc?<\/p>\n<p>Has anyone used a DJ through Sandals or hired any of the calypso bands...steel drum players? etc.....<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Your input is greatly appreciated XOX<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I would also be interested if anyone had any input on this. LOL \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Which Resort are you getting married at JennaMarie?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"xoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxo","Email":"berly12@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"209.6.118.164","GroupId":56,"GroupName":"Community Manager","JoinDate":1369365642,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-269909.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":158,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"RaynDrop","Id":269909,"Name":"RaynDrop","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"72.177.207.218","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76602,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"24d3f304cb3b6f9f45aa8d206a4e25eb","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;We are going to Sandals Whitehouse and are set for a 3pm ceremony too. &amp;nbsp;We leave in 3 days so I will have to get back on how it went&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1849440,"PostDate":1399745397,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>We are going to Sandals Whitehouse and are set for a 3pm ceremony too. \u00a0We leave in 3 days so I will have to get back on how it went<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jessica.f.waggoner.mil@mail.mil","IpAddress":"192.138.57.36","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1399564397,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"seka21","Id":277895,"Name":"seka21","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"209.6.118.164","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76602,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f9a84428d5b65d4901036c64bc9e5653","RawContent":"[quote name=\"seka21\" post=\"1849440\" timestamp=\"1399741797\"]\nWe are going to Sandals Whitehouse and are set for a 3pm ceremony too.  We leave in 3 days so I will have to get back on how it went[\/quote]\n\nOhh Congrats!!!   Can&#039;t wait to hear allllll about your wonderful day!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1849586,"PostDate":1399784245,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>seka21, on 10 May 2014 - 10:09 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>We are going to Sandals Whitehouse and are set for a 3pm ceremony too. \u00a0We leave in 3 days so I will have to get back on how it went<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Ohh Congrats!!! \u00a0 Can't wait to hear allllll about your wonderful day!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"xoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxoxo","Email":"berly12@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"209.6.118.164","GroupId":56,"GroupName":"Community Manager","JoinDate":1369365642,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-269909.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":158,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"RaynDrop","Id":269909,"Name":"RaynDrop","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"205.131.188.5","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76602,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9559445865388a3c26b68346905733bd","RawContent":"[quote name=\"JennaMarie901\" post=\"1838477\" timestamp=\"1395012113\"]\nHi All! We are having our DW at Sandals Montego Bay  this November  1 12014   with  approximately 20 of our closest friends and family, A couple of questions I have for anyone who has been married at sandals. \n\nHas anyone ever had a similar situation\n\nCeremony 3pm with some picture taking afterwards\n\nFollowed by cocktail hour\n\nFollowed by sit down dinner \n\nFollowed by reception. ( i am hoping to have a lounge\/firepit type area) with tiki torches etc.\n\n\nJust wondering if the progression of your evening went smoothly and if  you were able to change locations for each  (cocktail hr\/ dinner\/ reception).\n\ni Wanted to do hanging lanterns for the cocktail hour and then the lit up stars for dinner since it will be dark out most definitely by then.\n\nAnyone hire any of the entertainment like the fire dancers? etc?\nHas anyone used a DJ through Sandals or hired any of the calypso bands...steel drum players? etc.....\n\nYour input is greatly appreciated XOX[\/quote]\nAre all of your guests staying at Sandals? If so, are any of the things you mentioned given at no add&#039;l cost? Their options of a free cocktail hour and reception based on the numbers of rooms your party books make it a tempting venue but I am still reseaching!","Attachments":[],"Id":1868037,"PostDate":1408648605,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>JennaMarie901, on 16 March 2014 - 04:21 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hi All! We are having our DW at Sandals Montego Bay \u00a0this November \u00a01 12014 \u00a0 with \u00a0approximately 20 of our closest friends and family, A couple of questions I have for anyone who has been married at sandals.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Has anyone ever had a similar situation<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Ceremony 3pm with some picture taking afterwards<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Followed by cocktail hour<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Followed by sit down dinner\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Followed by reception. ( i am hoping to have a lounge\/firepit type area) with tiki torches etc.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Just wondering if the progression of your evening went smoothly and if \u00a0you were able to change locations for each \u00a0(cocktail hr\/ dinner\/ reception).<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>i Wanted to do hanging lanterns for the cocktail hour and then the lit up stars for dinner since it will be dark out most definitely by then.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Anyone hire any of the entertainment like the fire dancers? etc?<\/p>\n<p>Has anyone used a DJ through Sandals or hired any of the calypso bands...steel drum players? etc.....<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Your input is greatly appreciated XOX<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Are all of your guests staying at Sandals? If so, are any of the things you mentioned given at no add'l cost? Their options of a free\u00a0cocktail hour and reception based on the numbers of rooms your party books make it a tempting venue but I am still reseaching! \u00a0\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cylialoweesq@gmail.com","IpAddress":"205.131.188.5","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1408638312,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"FormattedName":"CEL1908","Id":279514,"Name":"CEL1908","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.46.185.191","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76602,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by JennaMarie901, 21 August 2014 - 02:25 PM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1408659904,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"338b423e0df4bfd7a7ba0254af92a800","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Yes all of my guests are staying at Sandals. But no they do not give anything at no add&#039;l cost. And its pretty expensive. But thats not to say you can&#039;t still have a gorgeous wedding with what they do provide. They give you that Beautiful Beginnings Package which comes with some basic things and the ceremony itself. &amp;nbsp;I am paying $45 per guest for a sit down dinner. approximatley $790 for decor - $1250 for entertainment such as the steel drum band, speaker rental, and fire dancer. &amp;nbsp;Really the only thing that I did not like though was that they only give you one appetizer and one dinner option for all of your guests. If you wanted to add more options its an additional cost and you have to ask your guests what they want months before the trip. Everything else though has been a pleasant experience. I have 2 months to go~!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1868075,"PostDate":1408659886,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Yes all of my guests are staying at Sandals. But no they do not give anything at no add'l cost. And its pretty expensive. But thats not to say you can't still have a gorgeous wedding with what they do provide. They give you that Beautiful Beginnings Package which comes with some basic things and the ceremony itself. \u00a0I am paying $45 per guest for a sit down dinner. approximatley $790 for decor - $1250 for entertainment such as the steel drum band, speaker rental, and fire dancer. \u00a0Really the only thing that I did not like though was that they only give you one appetizer and one dinner option for all of your guests. If you wanted to add more options its an additional cost and you have to ask your guests what they want months before the trip. Everything else though has been a pleasant experience. I have 2 months to go~!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>One Love\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/><\/p>\n<p>Jenna","Email":"jennamarie901@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"69.115.233.155","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1395014423,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277173.jpg?_r=1395012379","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JennaMarie901","Id":277173,"Name":"JennaMarie901","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"171.159.64.10","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76602,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b6b89ad2e32409ef71f485772e0bf085","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;i did my wedding on June&amp;nbsp; 7,2014 at sandals whitehouse. It was amazing.&amp;nbsp; i did my ceremony on beach at gazebo, did coctail reception at firepits and after dinner at restaurant.&amp;nbsp;they really cater to you to make everything wonderful&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1869356,"PostDate":1409151950,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>i did my wedding on June\u00a0 7,2014 at sandals whitehouse. It was amazing.\u00a0 i did my ceremony on beach at gazebo, did coctail reception at firepits and after dinner at restaurant.\u00a0they really cater to you to make everything wonderful\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shugapop12@aol.com","IpAddress":"66.87.100.226","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1369920425,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270119.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"shugapop1","Id":270119,"Name":"shugapop1","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.125.116.146","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76602,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"50c594b1955caaccee3123f98a2c4434","RawContent":"[quote name=\"JennaMarie901\" post=\"1868075\" timestamp=\"1408656286\"]\nYes all of my guests are staying at Sandals. But no they do not give anything at no add&#039;l cost. And its pretty expensive. But thats not to say you can&#039;t still have a gorgeous wedding with what they do provide. They give you that Beautiful Beginnings Package which comes with some basic things and the ceremony itself.  I am paying $45 per guest for a sit down dinner. approximatley $790 for decor - $1250 for entertainment such as the steel drum band, speaker rental, and fire dancer.  Really the only thing that I did not like though was that they only give you one appetizer and one dinner option for all of your guests. If you wanted to add more options its an additional cost and you have to ask your guests what they want months before the trip. Everything else though has been a pleasant experience. I have 2 months to go~![\/quote]Hey I&#039;m getting married at Grande Riviera on Nov. 4th and we have almost the same number of people going. 18 including us. I&#039;m also doing the ceremony at 3pm and am requesting the sit down reception at 5pm since that&#039;s closest to dinner time. That will allow time for pictures, etc. I&#039;m also having my ceremony and my reception in different areas of the resort.\n\nSo we have the free cocktail hour so we&#039;re paying $57 per person for the reception dinner (total of 3 hours, and open bar for the whole time, even the free cocktail hour.. that&#039;s $12pp so that&#039;s why it&#039;s $45 + $12 = $57pp). Also adding a DJ for 3 hours.\n\nI&#039;m still deciding on the menu. I hate having to decide on ONE choice for each course. I also do not like any of the appetizer options lol so I&#039;m trying to get some more options -- my wedding planner (here, not from Sandals) said that once you get to the resort you have some flexibility with the menu -- more than you do with the WC you are assigned from Sandals.","Attachments":[],"Id":1869569,"PostDate":1409250120,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>JennaMarie901, on 21 August 2014 - 02:24 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Yes all of my guests are staying at Sandals. But no they do not give anything at no add'l cost. And its pretty expensive. But thats not to say you can't still have a gorgeous wedding with what they do provide. They give you that Beautiful Beginnings Package which comes with some basic things and the ceremony itself. \u00a0I am paying $45 per guest for a sit down dinner. approximatley $790 for decor - $1250 for entertainment such as the steel drum band, speaker rental, and fire dancer. \u00a0Really the only thing that I did not like though was that they only give you one appetizer and one dinner option for all of your guests. If you wanted to add more options its an additional cost and you have to ask your guests what they want months before the trip. Everything else though has been a pleasant experience. I have 2 months to go~!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Hey I'm getting married at Grande Riviera on Nov. 4th and we have almost the same number of people going. 18 including us. I'm also doing the ceremony at 3pm and am requesting the sit down reception at 5pm since that's closest to dinner time. That will allow time for pictures, etc. I'm also having my ceremony and my reception in different areas of the resort.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>So we have the free cocktail hour so we're paying $57 per person for the reception dinner (total of 3 hours, and open bar for the whole time, even the free cocktail hour.. that's $12pp so that's why it's $45 + $12 = $57pp). Also adding a DJ for 3 hours.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm still deciding on the menu. I hate having to decide on ONE choice for each course. I also do not like any of the appetizer options lol so I'm trying to get some more options -- my wedding planner (here, not from Sandals) said that once you get to the resort you have some flexibility with the menu -- more than you do with the WC you are assigned from Sandals.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lild428@aol.com","IpAddress":"208.125.116.146","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1395764666,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277323.jpg?_r=1395959106","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lild428","Id":277323,"Name":"lild428","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.150.255.13","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76602,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e697b9851698e97a2066c8ad7c5283fb","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"lild428\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Just a few more days! I wonder if you even follow this site anymore but I noticed a couple of your posts and your wedding sounds like what I&#039;m hoping mine to be. Would love to see the pics you get and hear any advice when you get back for a fellow Sandals bride (9\/2015).&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Have fun and congrats!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1877260,"PostDate":1414607337,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277323\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277323-lild428\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">lild428<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Just a few more days! I wonder if you even follow this site anymore but I noticed a couple of your posts and your wedding sounds like what I'm hoping mine to be. Would love to see the pics you get and hear any advice when you get back for a fellow Sandals bride (9\/2015).<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Have fun and congrats!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sryan921@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"75.150.255.13","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1412975288,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280451.jpg?_r=1412972905","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"sryan921","Id":280451,"Name":"sryan921","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"63.119.165.142","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76602,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ab94138e14df47aa0223f523fe8c0c5c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Im getting married April 9th at Sandals Grande Rivieria!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We are just inviting parents, so I think we will just venture to one of the many onsite restuarants for dinner after the 30 minute reception. Honestly, not blown away by the seated dinner options, and just find it silly to spend the extra $$ when we are at an AI! I also like that it will give our parents an option to choose their own dinner&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Has anyone else done this? Suggestions on which restuarant? Im leaning towards Bayside or Reef Terrance.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1878671,"PostDate":1416354772,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Im getting married April 9th at Sandals Grande Rivieria!!!<\/p>\n<p>We are just inviting parents, so I think we will just venture to one of the many onsite restuarants for dinner after the 30 minute reception. Honestly, not blown away by the seated dinner options, and just find it silly to spend the extra $$ when we are at an AI! I also like that it will give our parents an option to choose their own dinner<\/p>\n<p>Has anyone else done this? Suggestions on which restuarant? Im leaning towards Bayside or Reef Terrance.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mlvhess@gmail.com","IpAddress":"158.222.184.200","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1416187087,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"yogahhh","Id":281177,"Name":"yogahhh","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"76602","Title":"Sandals Brides! How Did Your Evening Progress?","LastPostDate":1420828578},"Pages":{"TotalItems":11,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
