{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.125.116.146","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77278,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fcadf22f7a79ce3fe58bf625ce458a5f","RawContent":"[quote name=\"redsoxgrl\" post=\"1857643\" timestamp=\"1404176162\"]\nI would talk to your WC and see what can be done. Sandals has photography partners which are real photographers (not snapshots ones) but they are OUTRAGEOUS. Are you super locked into sandals? I know a lot if other resorts DO allow offsite photogs. Otherwise maybe you can see if you can get samples of some of the snapshots work[\/quote]\nthanks. and yea, we&#039;re locked into sandals. we (and all the guests) put a deposit down for the week. i really like it there so i do want to stick with it.. just makes it hard with photography.","Attachments":[],"Id":1857710,"PostDate":1404231872,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>redsoxgrl, on 30 June 2014 - 05:56 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>I would talk to your WC and see what can be done. Sandals has photography partners which are real photographers (not snapshots ones) but they are OUTRAGEOUS. Are you super locked into sandals? I know a lot if other resorts DO allow offsite photogs. Otherwise maybe you can see if you can get samples of some of the snapshots work<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>thanks. and yea, we're locked into sandals. we (and all the guests) put a deposit down for the week. i really like it there so i do want to stick with it.. just makes it hard with photography.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lild428@aol.com","IpAddress":"208.125.116.146","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1395764666,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277323.jpg?_r=1395959106","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lild428","Id":277323,"Name":"lild428","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"74.103.244.195","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77278,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"66e49ab664449906010af3d28d1daf44","RawContent":"[quote name=\"lild428\" post=\"1857710\" timestamp=\"1404228272\"]\nthanks. and yea, we&#039;re locked into sandals. we (and all the guests) put a deposit down for the week. i really like it there so i do want to stick with it.. just makes it hard with photography.[\/quote] Yea, i agree.  I had heard of the photography crap before booking so i already had my contingency plan.  haha.  We had to get sandals bc we wanted a butler room....i can&#039;t wait for have a butler for the week! lol","Attachments":[],"Id":1857713,"PostDate":1404232461,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>lild428, on 01 July 2014 - 08:24 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>thanks. and yea, we're locked into sandals. we (and all the guests) put a deposit down for the week. i really like it there so i do want to stick with it.. just makes it hard with photography.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0Yea, i agree. \u00a0I had heard of the photography crap before booking so i already had my contingency plan. \u00a0haha. \u00a0We had to get sandals bc we wanted a butler room....i can't wait for have a butler for the week! lol<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jadichristofaro@gmail.com","IpAddress":"198.7.227.141","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1369834006,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270079.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"redsoxgrl","Id":270079,"Name":"redsoxgrl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.125.116.146","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77278,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d2f7ebd26314f02748af7d99a0feffd0","RawContent":"[quote name=\"redsoxgrl\" post=\"1857713\" timestamp=\"1404228861\"]\n Yea, i agree.  I had heard of the photography crap before booking so i already had my contingency plan.  haha.  We had to get sandals bc we wanted a butler room....i can&#039;t wait for have a butler for the week! lol[\/quote]We just opted for the Beachfront concierge room in the Riviera building.. I like oceanview ;)\n\nSo I asked my wedding planner what the prices were for the \"partner\" photographers and was BLOWN AWAY.\n\nFor 4 hours of shooting and UP TO 200 edited images on a CD...\nAnywheres from $2,800 to $4,250!! Holy crap..","Attachments":[],"Id":1857932,"PostDate":1404324662,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>redsoxgrl, on 01 July 2014 - 08:34 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>\u00a0Yea, i agree. \u00a0I had heard of the photography crap before booking so i already had my contingency plan. \u00a0haha. \u00a0We had to get sandals bc we wanted a butler room....i can't wait for have a butler for the week! lol<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>We just opted for the Beachfront concierge room in the Riviera building.. I like oceanview <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>So I asked my wedding planner what the prices were for the \"partner\" photographers and was BLOWN AWAY.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>For 4 hours of shooting and UP TO 200 edited images on a CD...<\/p>\n<p>Anywheres from $2,800 to $4,250!! Holy crap..<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lild428@aol.com","IpAddress":"208.125.116.146","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1395764666,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277323.jpg?_r=1395959106","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lild428","Id":277323,"Name":"lild428","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"74.103.244.195","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77278,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"92e1bc6512d33b97fb38692ac7ba4784","RawContent":"[quote name=\"lild428\" post=\"1857932\" timestamp=\"1404321062\"]\nWe just opted for the Beachfront concierge room in the Riviera building.. I like oceanview ;)\n\nSo I asked my wedding planner what the prices were for the \"partner\" photographers and was BLOWN AWAY.\n\nFor 4 hours of shooting and UP TO 200 edited images on a CD...\nAnywheres from $2,800 to $4,250!! Holy crap..[\/quote]Yup and the sad part is, once I picked my jaw up off the ground I emailed a few of them thru their websites and didn&#039;t tell them I was getting married at sandals and the prices were almost 2k cheaper so obv sandals is making lots of money anyways off these people! Crazy. The biggest problem with sandals is the photography. Just charge a vendor fee and let your guests bring whomever they want like other resorts!!\n\nI hope you can find a option that works for you :(","Attachments":[],"Id":1857935,"PostDate":1404325078,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>lild428, on 02 July 2014 - 10:11 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>We just opted for the Beachfront concierge room in the Riviera building.. I like oceanview <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/><br><br>\nSo I asked my wedding planner what the prices were for the \"partner\" photographers and was BLOWN AWAY.<br><br>\nFor 4 hours of shooting and UP TO 200 edited images on a CD...<br>\nAnywheres from $2,800 to $4,250!! Holy crap..<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nYup and the sad part is, once I picked my jaw up off the ground I emailed a few of them thru their websites and didn't tell them I was getting married at sandals and the prices were almost 2k cheaper so obv sandals is making lots of money anyways off these people! Crazy. The biggest problem with sandals is the photography. Just charge a vendor fee and let your guests bring whomever they want like other resorts!!<br><br>\nI hope you can find a option that works for you <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/> \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jadichristofaro@gmail.com","IpAddress":"198.7.227.141","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1369834006,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270079.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"redsoxgrl","Id":270079,"Name":"redsoxgrl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.125.116.146","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77278,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7af157840162dbca6dcba44a6afdd1db","RawContent":"[quote name=\"redsoxgrl\" post=\"1857935\" timestamp=\"1404321478\"]\nYup and the sad part is, once I picked my jaw up off the ground I emailed a few of them thru their websites and didn&#039;t tell them I was getting married at sandals and the prices were almost 2k cheaper so obv sandals is making lots of money anyways off these people! Crazy. The biggest problem with sandals is the photography. Just charge a vendor fee and let your guests bring whomever they want like other resorts!!\n\nI hope you can find a option that works for you :([\/quote]Thanks - I did email one of them for their prices and one of their first questions was \"where are you getting married?\" I said I&#039;m not sure yet lol and I&#039;m still waiting on a price list.\n\nI mean honestly, some of the differences between what the photog charges and what Sandals charges for them are close if not more than what it would cost to pay for 3 nights lol","Attachments":[],"Id":1857938,"PostDate":1404325365,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>redsoxgrl, on 02 July 2014 - 10:17 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Yup and the sad part is, once I picked my jaw up off the ground I emailed a few of them thru their websites and didn't tell them I was getting married at sandals and the prices were almost 2k cheaper so obv sandals is making lots of money anyways off these people! Crazy. The biggest problem with sandals is the photography. Just charge a vendor fee and let your guests bring whomever they want like other resorts!!<br><br>\nI hope you can find a option that works for you <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Thanks - I did email one of them for their prices and one of their first questions was \"where are you getting married?\" I said I'm not sure yet lol and I'm still waiting on a price list.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I mean honestly, some of the differences between what the photog charges and what Sandals charges for them are close if not more than what it would cost to pay for 3 nights lol<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lild428@aol.com","IpAddress":"208.125.116.146","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1395764666,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277323.jpg?_r=1395959106","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lild428","Id":277323,"Name":"lild428","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"74.103.244.195","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77278,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ca4b1a7e431992b32a0b36a1f275ea02","RawContent":"[quote name=\"lild428\" post=\"1857938\" timestamp=\"1404321765\"]\nThanks - I did email one of them for their prices and one of their first questions was \"where are you getting married?\" I said I&#039;m not sure yet lol and I&#039;m still waiting on a price list.\n\nI mean honestly, some of the differences between what the photog charges and what Sandals charges for them are close if not more than what it would cost to pay for 3 nights lol[\/quote]That is true ;) no one said u have to put them in the most expensive room!","Attachments":[],"Id":1857944,"PostDate":1404325803,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>lild428, on 02 July 2014 - 10:22 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Thanks - I did email one of them for their prices and one of their first questions was \"where are you getting married?\" I said I'm not sure yet lol and I'm still waiting on a price list.<br><br>\nI mean honestly, some of the differences between what the photog charges and what Sandals charges for them are close if not more than what it would cost to pay for 3 nights lol<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nThat is true <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/> no one said u have to put them in the most expensive room! \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jadichristofaro@gmail.com","IpAddress":"198.7.227.141","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1369834006,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270079.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"redsoxgrl","Id":270079,"Name":"redsoxgrl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"67.193.91.193","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77278,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2718c1946994956e7216d35d5da208d1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;After reading this post, I see the value in bringing your own photographer or certainly paying&amp;nbsp;for an outsider.   I also like the idea of your photos being taken throughout&amp;nbsp;the week. &amp;nbsp;Of all days, you want your pictures to be spectacular and not left to chance.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks for this.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1867240,"PostDate":1408295880,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>After reading this post, I see the value in bringing your own photographer or certainly paying\u00a0for an outsider.\u00a0\u00a0 I also like the idea of your photos being taken throughout\u00a0the week. \u00a0Of all days, you want your pictures to be spectacular and not left to chance.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks for this.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"boomer_396@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"67.193.91.193","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1404250553,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Brinley","Id":278775,"Name":"Brinley","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.125.116.146","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77278,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"aa285e527f2a0cf29e8ef2ae09068ec0","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Brinley\" post=\"1867240\" timestamp=\"1408292280\"]\nAfter reading this post, I see the value in bringing your own photographer or certainly paying for an outsider.   I also like the idea of your photos being taken throughout the week.  Of all days, you want your pictures to be spectacular and not left to chance.\n\nThanks for this.[\/quote]\nI tried this route but the photog I really wanted was willing to go but wanted a crazy amount of money plus all expenses paid. I don&#039;t think he quite realized how much a Sandals resort costs - even for just one night. It wouldn&#039;t have been a \"vacation\" for him since he would not be bringing his family.\n\nSo I&#039;m just getting a very cheap Sandals photographer package - digital only for like $600 something - I can always add more photos if I like them. Plus, we have our family and friends who can take photos. I used to be obsessed with the photo thing, but it just stressed me out so I decided not to worry. If I need to come back home and get dressed back up for those \"must have\" shots, I can hire a photog home for way cheaper than usual since it would only be a couple hour photoshoot :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1869701,"PostDate":1409319350,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Brinley, on 17 August 2014 - 09:18 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>After reading this post, I see the value in bringing your own photographer or certainly paying\u00a0for an outsider.\u00a0\u00a0 I also like the idea of your photos being taken throughout\u00a0the week. \u00a0Of all days, you want your pictures to be spectacular and not left to chance.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks for this.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I tried this route but the photog I really wanted was willing to go but wanted a crazy amount of money plus all expenses paid. I don't think he quite realized how much a Sandals resort costs - even for just one night. It wouldn't have been a \"vacation\" for him since he would not be bringing his family.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>So I'm just getting a very cheap Sandals photographer package - digital only for like $600 something - I can always add more photos if I like them. Plus, we have our family and friends who can take photos. I used to be obsessed with the photo thing, but it just stressed me out so I decided not to worry. If I need to come back home and get dressed back up for those \"must have\" shots, I can hire a photog home for way cheaper than usual since it would only be a couple hour photoshoot <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lild428@aol.com","IpAddress":"208.125.116.146","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1395764666,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277323.jpg?_r=1395959106","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lild428","Id":277323,"Name":"lild428","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":28,"TotalPages":3,"CurrentPage":20,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":10,"LastPage":20},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
