r and makeup .... or should I pay them to do it for me?&amp;nbsp; I&#039;m very particular with my hair &amp;amp; makeup.&amp;nbsp; But, I want it to be PERFECT.&amp;nbsp; I can not find ANY reviews on the resorts Hair Stylists and makeup artists.&amp;nbsp; All&#039;s I can find is they hype about a few artists you can pay from offsite to do your makeup.&amp;nbsp; HELP!&amp;nbsp; Should I spend the $300 &amp;amp; take the chance of regretting it because there are NO reviews to go by!&amp;nbsp; Any insight will be helpful!&amp;nbsp; Thanks :-)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1853709,"PostDate":1401842815,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I am getting married July 23, 2014 at Sandals Negril.\u00a0 I don't know if I should just do my own hair and makeup .... or should I pay them to do it for me?\u00a0 I'm very particular with my hair & makeup.\u00a0 But, I want it to be PERFECT.\u00a0 I can not find ANY reviews on the resorts Hair Stylists and makeup artists.\u00a0 All's I can find is they hype about a few artists you can pay from offsite to do your makeup.\u00a0 HELP!\u00a0 Should I spend the $300 & take the chance of regretting it because there are NO reviews to go by!\u00a0 Any insight will be helpful!\u00a0 Thanks :-)<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"austynrj79@aol.com","IpAddress":"24.93.242.253","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1390094354,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276187.jpg?_r=1401839430","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":201,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KHall79","Id":276187,"Name":"KHall79","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"198.7.227.141","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77226,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1d367b4d27f3d98540b4a9721cb0e906","RawContent":"I replied on the other thread but I see now you are getting married 5 days ahead of me lol! I booked hair\/makeup trial and then hair\/makeup day of. I figure it&#039;s going to be humid as all hell and they must be good at doing hair (better than I am!) and as for makeup, I was told they use MAC products. I have extremely sensitive skin so I had to do a trial here at a MAC counter and I will be bringing some MAC products with me to use from from the mineralize line. It was 265 for the trial\/day of and most of it was paid by the 500 credit for me. I already booked an offsite photographer to whisk us away after our wedding for photos around Negril and sunset TTD bc I heard sandals photogs are not so good so i didn&#039;t want to spend more money and have to go off resort for hair and makeup. I figure the trial should help calm my nerves too!","Attachments":[],"Id":1854236,"PostDate":1402143315,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I replied on the other thread but I see now you are getting married 5 days ahead of me lol! I booked hair\/makeup trial and then hair\/makeup day of. I figure it's going to be humid as all hell and they must be good at doing hair (better than I am!) and as for makeup, I was told they use MAC products. I have extremely sensitive skin so I had to do a trial here at a MAC counter and I will be bringing some MAC products with me to use from from the mineralize line. It was 265 for the trial\/day of and most of it was paid by the 500 credit for me. I already booked an offsite photographer to whisk us away after our wedding for photos around Negril and sunset TTD bc I heard sandals photogs are not so good so i didn't want to spend more money and have to go off resort for hair and makeup. I figure the trial should help calm my nerves too! \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jadichristofaro@gmail.com","IpAddress":"198.7.227.141","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1369834006,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270079.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"redsoxgrl","Id":270079,"Name":"redsoxgrl","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"77226","Title":"Hair & Makeup At Sandals Negril? Help!","LastPostDate":1402143315},"Pages":{"TotalItems":2,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
