{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":198,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":10779,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1402034,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":235756,"Name":"beachesSB1412","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-235756.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":159,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1298232025,"LastPoster":{"Id":277895,"Name":"seka21","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":89,"Preview":{"Id":1849297,"PostDate":1399666574,"PostContent":"Beautiful!!!","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jessica.f.waggoner.mil@mail.mil","IpAddress":"192.138.57.36","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1399564397,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"seka21","Id":277895,"Name":"seka21","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":59776,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6aca98970a207fbcac0ca6e51abce4f3","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]BSB121212[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Thanks, I have now deiced to go with the BB theme and save some cash. But now I am having trouble picking my colors. Cause the flowers are purple I feel I need to have purple in the colors but I would love to use orange and teal,  I&#039;m not sure how it will work with the purple. I am going to bring silk flowers for the bouquets but the table still has the purple right. Oh and dose anyone know the option for where you can do the reception? Like can it be on the beach?[\/quote] \n Hello - I thought about bringing silk flowers as well. During our wedding planning call they mentioned that customs may these items.  Have you seen any other reviews regarding taking items along. Also you doing any wedding favors?","Attachments":[],"Id":1643849,"PostDate":1342899256,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>BSB121212<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Thanks, I have now deiced to go with the BB theme and save some cash. But now I am having trouble picking my colors. Cause the flowers are purple I feel I need to have purple in the colors but I would love to use orange and teal, \u00a0I'm not sure how it will work with the purple. I am going to bring silk flowers for the bouquets but the table still has the purple right. Oh and dose anyone know the option for where you can do the reception? Like can it be on the beach?<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> Hello - I thought about bringing silk flowers as well. During our wedding planning call they mentioned that customs may these items.\u00a0 Have you seen any other reviews regarding taking items along. Also you doing any wedding favors?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"HbrownRN@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1342859328,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-258128.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jamaica2013","Id":258128,"Name":"Jamaica2013","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":59776,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f062a27019571919b763f5e0702112ba","RawContent":"Awesome photos! I see you had fans in the chairs. Did you bring your own or purchase them from Beaches? [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Trimalusta[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Hi! \n \n I thought I&#039;d post some of my photos from Beaches Negril.  The photos are: \n \n Beautiful Begininnigs ceremony with additional Vision in White Arch \n Beautiful Beginnings white flower table setting (we only had three tables, so they were all faced towards eachother) \n Oceanside Luncheon Buffet pics \n A Red Stripe photo op! \n \n Our Ceremony was on the beach and reception was in the gazebo right next to the ceremony site.  It was amazing and very low key, we had 22 people including us. \n ![img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/778598\/width\/600\/height\/400[\/img][img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/778600\/width\/600\/height\/400[\/img] \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/778592\/width\/600\/height\/402[\/img] \n \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/778602\/width\/600\/height\/400[\/img] \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/778604\/width\/600\/height\/400[\/img] \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/778608\/width\/600\/height\/400[\/img][\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1643851,"PostDate":1342899399,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Awesome photos! I see you had fans in the chairs. Did you bring your own or purchase them from Beaches?<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Trimalusta<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Hi!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I thought I'd post some of my photos from Beaches Negril.\u00a0 The photos are:<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Beautiful Begininnigs ceremony with additional Vision in White Arch<\/p> <p> Beautiful Beginnings white flower table setting (we only had three tables, so they were all faced towards eachother)<\/p> <p> Oceanside Luncheon Buffet pics<\/p> <p> A Red Stripe photo op!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Our Ceremony was on the beach and reception was in the gazebo right next to the ceremony site.\u00a0 It was amazing and very low key, we had 22 people including us.<\/p> <p> !<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"beutfulbegTABLE.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/778598\/width\/600\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"bar.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/778600\/width\/600\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p> 